{"product_id":"like-it-happened-yesterday","title":"Like It Happened Yesterday","description":"\u003cp\u003eHas anyone ever asked you-What were the best days of your life? That one period of your life you always wanted to go back to? When asked this, I closed my eyes and I thought . . . of the days when life's most complex choices had the simple solution of Akkad Bakkad Bambey Bo! When rains meant making paper boats; when waiting at the railway crossing meant counting the bogies of the trains passing by. When I opened my eyes, it seemed Like It Happened Yesterday; when I felt my hormones stirring inside me, as I was awaiting the results of my board exams; when I fell in love for the very first time! The past is a journey full of adventure. It makes me laugh, it makes me cry and it is the reason I'm here today. Come, hold my hand and take this trip with me. It will be yesterday for you, once again! \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:16 x 203  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Indian Writers IWRI | Ravinder Singh \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780143418801 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 216\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44914546770073,"sku":"12RB9780143418801","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/30e1b44ce9f70b4ae6d5e212a06764cd.jpg?v=1729769127","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/like-it-happened-yesterday","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}